---
/*
 * A panel around the last section of the home page.
 *
 * The page ended on a paragraph running the full width of the layout, which
 * reads as the page having stopped rather than finished. Inside the panel the
 * measure narrows to something a paragraph is meant to be read at, and the
 * surfaces move up a step so a code block still stands off its background.
 */
---

<section class="an-band">
  <div class="an-band__inner"><slot /></div>
</section>
